  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-023 (Phase 3 — engine / Parsing (`HFRParsing`)): MP list specifics + unread badge (one parser for the 3 legacy variants).\n\n### Scope\n\nMP list specifics + unread badge (one parser for the 3 legacy variants)\n\n- Module: HFRParsing · Difficulty: easy · Priority: medium · ★ critical path\n- Audit source: B6, NET-13\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-022 (#50)\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-023-mp-list.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-023-mp-list.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#19](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/19) — LOT-023: MP list parser and unread badge (merged; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#17](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/17) — chore(lots): claim wave 1 and record the wave plan (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#63](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/63) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: mac/w1-023-sonnet (2026-10-27)\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-mp-list-page-past-the-last (#114)\n- CAP-mp-list-row-of-a-one (#115)\n- CAP-mp-list-logged-out (#116)\n- CAP-forum-list-header-badge-with-n (#117)\n- CAP-mp-list-row-with-the-ignore (#118)\n- CAP-mp-pseudos-containing-a-comma (#119)\n- CAP-badge-on-a-logged-in-topic (#120)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#19)`.\n",
